{"format":1,"key":"zone:desolace","path":"/lore/zone/desolace","name":"Desolace","kind":"zone","label":"Zone","zone":{"key":"desolace","name":"Desolace","path":"/lore/zone/desolace"},"levels":"","description":"Desolace is a bleak, windswept desert on Kalimdor's western coast, defined by cracked gray earth, constant stormy skies, and the bones of fallen beasts.…","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"zone:desolace","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["Desolace is a bleak, windswept desert on Kalimdor's western coast, defined by cracked gray earth, constant stormy skies, and the bones of fallen beasts. It is the ancestral cradle of the vicious centaur race and a contested wasteland scarred by ancient Highborne ruins, encroaching demonic cults, and bitter tribal warfare. Both the Horde and Alliance maintain precarious footholds amidst the dust, each seeking to carve out influence while warding off spreading corruption.","Desolace was not always a barren expanse of ash and yellowed pools. Legend holds that the land withered when the earth elemental Princess Theradras drained the surrounding life force to regenerate her form. Zaetar, son of Cenarius, came to her, but rather than subduing her, he took the princess as his mate. From their unnatural union sprang the first centaur. In shame and bloodthirsty wrath, the newborn race murdered their father and overran the plains, leaving behind the scarred wasteland known today."],"hash":"235377","voices":{}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Desolace (Classic)","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Desolace_(Classic)"},{"kind":"wiki","title":"Desolace","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Desolace"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/subzone/nijel-s-point","n":"Nijel's Point","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/shadowprey-village","n":"Shadowprey Village","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/kodo-graveyard","n":"Kodo Graveyard","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/gelkis-village","n":"Gelkis Village","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/magram-village","n":"Magram Village","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/thunder-axe-fortress","n":"Thunder Axe Fortress","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/mannoroc-coven","n":"Mannoroc Coven","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/zone/stonetalon","n":"Stonetalon Mountains","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/npc/roetten-stonehammer","n":"Roetten Stonehammer","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/quest/1453-reclaimers-business-in-desolace","n":"Reclaimers' Business in Desolace","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/4021-counterattack","n":"Counterattack!","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/79192-stepping-stones","n":"Stepping Stones","k":"quest"}],"children":[{"p":"/lore/subzone/bolgan-s-hole","n":"Bolgan's Hole","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/ethel-rethor","n":"Ethel Rethor","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/gelkis-village","n":"Gelkis Village","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/ghost-walker-post","n":"Ghost Walker Post","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/kodo-graveyard","n":"Kodo Graveyard","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/kormek-s-hut","n":"Kormek's Hut","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/magram-village","n":"Magram Village","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/mannoroc-coven","n":"Mannoroc Coven","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/nijel-s-point","n":"Nijel's Point","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/sar-theris-strand","n":"Sar'theris Strand","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/sargeron","n":"Sargeron","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/shadowbreak-ravine","n":"Shadowbreak Ravine","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/shadowprey-village","n":"Shadowprey Village","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/thunder-axe-fortress","n":"Thunder Axe Fortress","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/valley-of-spears","n":"Valley of Spears","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/npc/felgur-twocuts","n":"Felgur Twocuts","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/kreldig-ungor","n":"Kreldig Ungor","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/maurin-bonesplitter","n":"Maurin Bonesplitter","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/misha","n":"Misha","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/taiga-wi